          "title": "Calculation of Glucose Molecular Mass",
          "problemStatement": "Calculate the molecular mass of glucose $C_6H_{12}O_6$ given atomic masses $C=12.011\\\\text{ u}$, $H=1.008\\\\text{ u}$, $O=16.00\\\\text{ u}$.",
          "stepByStepSolution": [
